  "description": "Both of these stocks meet all 5 of our basic parameters for purchase",
  "body_html": "<p><em>👋 Welcome to a<strong> 🔒 subscriber-only stock picks 🔒</strong></em>. Sometimes I get asked why I keep these picks hidden the last year. Simple…ever seen a liquidity spike when 100,000 people buy at the same time? Market makers love it…hence why a smaller crowd anymore. Both companies meet all of our basic requirements for a purchase, per the image below (save that!). The tickers can be found <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813?target_reply_id=8654fe6e-5ba7-4fd6-a2f2-52a34a1e7368&amp;showTarget=true\">here</a>, or in the StockTok tracker later today when I purchase, pending nothing crazy happens at market open.</p><p><em>For more: <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing for Beginners</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/timothys-stocktok-tracker?r=4z8lgl\">Current Stock Positions</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-daily-update?r=4z8lgl\">Daily Stock Screener</a> | <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to the Stock Screener. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!cXVi!,f_auto,